  <h2 class="cs-h2-wide">
    We built it.<br>
    <em>Then we watched.</em>
  </h2>
  <p class="body-text" style="font-size: 17px; max-width: 64ch;">
    After launching the MVP, we ran field research across 3 live events — observing real attendee behaviour directly, without surveys or assumptions. 5,360 attendees. Four research methods. What we found wasn't what we expected.
  </p>

  <div class="stat-row">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-n">3</div>
      <div class="stat-l">Live events observed</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-n">5,360</div>
      <div class="stat-l">Total attendees tracked</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat" style="border-right: 0;">
      <div class="stat-n">4</div>
      <div class="stat-l">Research methods employed</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px;">
    <div class="desktop-frame-wrap" style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="/images/Bizzabo-Live event reasearch 01.png" alt="Field research — live event 1">
    </div>
    <div class="desktop-frame-wrap" style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="/images/Bizzabo-Live event reasearch 02.png" alt="Field research — live event 2">
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="fig-cap">Field research conducted across 3 live events — observing real attendee behaviour in hybrid settings</p>

  <!-- Three findings — 3-col -->
  <div class="finding-grid-3">
    <div class="finding-3">
      <div class="finding-3-stat">1/5</div>
      <div class="finding-t">Discovery was the bottleneck</div>
      <div class="finding-b">Only 1 in 5 reached messages. Those who found it used it — 23% sent one.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="finding-3">
      <div class="finding-3-stat">4%</div>
      <div class="finding-t">Conversations stayed shallow</div>
      <div class="finding-b">69% read, 52% replied. Only 4% reached a real back-and-forth.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="finding-3">
      <div class="finding-3-stat">2×</div>
      <div class="finding-t">Pre-event engagement predicted connection</div>
      <div class="finding-b">Attendees who explored before the event were 2× more likely to message during it.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Funnel -->
  <div class="funnel-block">
    <div class="funnel-head">
